This product downloads a CBP ruling index (cross-rulings-index-*.jsonl.gz) from the
Sora GitHub releases on first use of HTS prediction. The index contains:

1. Data built from U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) classification rulings,
   which are works of the U.S. Government. Product names and descriptions were
   rewritten from the ruling text; names of people and companies were left out or
   removed where found.

2. Data derived from "CROSS Rulings HTS Dataset for Tariff Classification"
   by Flexify.AI Inc. (https://www.flexify.ai),
   https://huggingface.co/datasets/flexifyai/cross_rulings_hts_dataset_for_tariffs,
   licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
   (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
   Changes: only the product description in each question and the codes in the
   first answer line are kept; names, numbers and codes were removed from the
   description. These entries carry no ruling number and are used only as votes.

3. Data taken from "AI-Extracted CBP Customs Rulings Dataset"
   (fklc/cbp-rulings-past-2012,
   https://huggingface.co/datasets/fklc/cbp-rulings-past-2012),
   used for rulings dated 2012 or later.
   Changes: only the ruling number, date, product name, product description and
   code of each item are kept; names, numbers and codes were removed from the
   names and descriptions.

